## Project Progress

Reviewed the latest progress of the Residential College Network project and the updated network design.

Completed my assigned **Responsible Network Use Policy** section. The policy defines expectations for residents, guests, staff and other authorised users when using the Residential College Network. It covers authorised network access, account and device security, prohibited activities, responsible use of shared network resources, network monitoring, incident reporting and consequences of network misuse.

I also reviewed how the policy relates to the technical security controls planned for the project, including VLAN separation, Network Access Control (NAC), firewall restrictions, monitoring and the quarantine network.

